<head type="main">»Spørg <seg target="txtcmnt-286-01" part="N"><!--DATA-TERM: Amagermo’er--><anchor target="txtcmnt-286-01"/><!--amagerkone, dvs. kone fra Amager, som handler med grøntsager, frugt osv.--><?oxy_comment_start author="as" timestamp="20240108T113515+0100" comment="Med stort eller lille begyndelsesbogstav?"?><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20240108T113506+0100" content="A"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20240108T113505+0100"?>a<?oxy_comment_end?><?oxy_insert_end?>magermo<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093609+0100"?>r<?oxy_insert_end?><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093610+0100" content="’er"?></seg>«!</head>


<lg xml:id="p_00001" part="N" org="uniform" sample="complete">
<l part="N">Der var en ældgammel gulerod,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093720+0100" content="S"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093719+0100"?>s<?oxy_insert_end?>å knoldet, så tyk og så tung,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093723+0100" content="D"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093723+0100"?>d<?oxy_insert_end?>en havde et ganske forfærdeligt mod,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093728+0100" content="D"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093728+0100"?>d<?oxy_insert_end?>en <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093734+0100" content="vilde"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093734+0100"?>ville<?oxy_insert_end?> gifte sig med en ung, en yndig ung,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T094631+0100" content="L"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T094630+0100"?>l<?oxy_insert_end?>ille gulerod af røddernes fineste blod.</l>
<l part="N">– Og brylluppet stod.</l>
<l part="N">Bev<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T094649+0100" content="e"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T094649+0100"?>æ<?oxy_insert_end?>rtningen var ubetalelig god,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T094655+0100" content="D"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T094654+0100"?>d<?oxy_insert_end?>en kostede slet ingen penge<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T094658+0100" content=";"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T094700+0100"?>.<?oxy_insert_end?></l>
<l part="N">De slikkede måneskin og drak dug<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T094702+0100" content="g"?>,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T094708+0100" content="T"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T094707+0100"?>t<?oxy_insert_end?>og blomsterfnug<?oxy_comment_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T095756+0100" comment="i tvivl om kommaet"?>,<?oxy_comment_end?></l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T094723+0100" content="S"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T094722+0100"?>s<?oxy_insert_end?>om det kom fra mark og enge.</l>
<l part="N">– Gammel gulerod hilste med et buk,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T094858+0100" content="O"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T094857+0100"?>o<?oxy_insert_end?>g talte så langt og så længe,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T094910+0100" content="D"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T094910+0100"?>d<?oxy_insert_end?>e ord de klukkede kluk i kluk<?oxy_comment_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T095119+0100" comment="er uikker på semikolon her. Skal det mon bare ud? Eller erstattes af punktum ligesom i linjerne:

som det kom fra mark og enge.
– Gammel gulerod hilste med et buk."?>;<?oxy_comment_end?></l>
<l part="N">– ung gulerod sagde ikke et muk,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T095810+0100" content="S"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T095810+0100"?>s<?oxy_insert_end?>ad uden at give et smil eller suk,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T095815+0100" content="U"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T095814+0100"?>u<?oxy_insert_end?>ng og smuk.</l>
<l rend="firstIndent" part="N">Hvis ikke du tror,</l>
<l rend="firstIndent" part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T095820+0100" content="S"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T095819+0100"?>s<?oxy_insert_end?>pørg amagermo<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T095822+0100"?>r<?oxy_insert_end?><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T095823+0100" content="’er"?>!</l>
</lg>

<lg xml:id="p_00002" part="N" org="uniform" sample="complete">
<l part="N">Et rødkålshoved var deres præst,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T095830+0100" content="O"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T095829+0100"?>o<?oxy_insert_end?>g brudepiger <seg target="txtcmnt-286-02" part="N"><!--DATA-TERM: Hvideroer--><anchor target="txtcmnt-286-02"/><!--haveturnips.-->hvid<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T100148+0100" content="e"?>roer</seg><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T100200+0100" content=";"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T100200+0100"?>.<?oxy_insert_end?></l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_comment_start author="as" timestamp="20240108T114039+0100" comment="er apostroffen fordi der er tale om en sammentrækning af &quot;argurker&quot;?"?>Agurk’<?oxy_comment_end?> og asparges sad som æresg<?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T100219+0100" content="e"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T100219+0100"?>æ<?oxy_insert_end?>st,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T100224+0100" content="K"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T100224+0100"?>k<?oxy_insert_end?>artoflerne stod og sang kor.</l>
<l part="N">Og der blev danset af lille og stor.</l>
<l part="N">Spørg amagermo<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T100302+0100"?>r<?oxy_insert_end?><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T100303+0100" content="’er"?>!</l>
<l part="N">Gammel gulerod sprang uden strømper og sko,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T101007+0100" content="H"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T101007+0100"?>h<?oxy_insert_end?>u, hej! Han revned’ i ryggen,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T101033+0100" content="O"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T101033+0100"?>o<?oxy_insert_end?>g så var han død, <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093744+0100" content="kunde"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093744+0100"?>kunne<?oxy_insert_end?> aldrig gro.</l>
<l part="N">Ung gulerod lo,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093804+0100" content="S"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093804+0100"?>s<?oxy_insert_end?>å underligt vender sig lykken.</l>
<l part="N">Nu var hun enke, nu var hun glad,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093801+0100" content="N"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093801+0100"?>n<?oxy_insert_end?>u <?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093744+0100" content="kunde"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093744+0100"?>kunne<?oxy_insert_end?> hun leve som helst hun gad,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093758+0100" content="Kunde"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093758+0100"?>kunne<?oxy_insert_end?> svømme som jomfru i suppefad,</l>
<l part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093754+0100" content="U"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093754+0100"?>u<?oxy_insert_end?>ng og glad.</l>
<l rend="firstIndent" part="N">Hvis ikke du tror,</l>
<l rend="firstIndent" part="N"><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T093751+0100" content="S"?><?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T093751+0100"?>s<?oxy_insert_end?>pørg amagermo<?oxy_insert_start author="as" timestamp="20231113T101104+0100"?>r<?oxy_insert_end?><?oxy_delete author="as" timestamp="20231113T101105+0100" content="’er"?>!</l>
</lg>

